      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DON'T TELL SHELL (1) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (25.87) at Shepparton in a Grade 5 over 450m. Expected to feature in the finish again. JED'S MEMORY (8) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Whoppi Devere (24.32) in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Can feature again. ROTHWELL BONNIE (3) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at Geelong following on from a second place finish (22.80) there the start prior. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Has ability and can atone. MY NAME'S EVELYN (4) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
